<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-11-08T23:50:40.077Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 23:50:40 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Supreme Court rejected President Hassan Sheikh Mohamud's term extension, prompting armed forces to seize the court and threaten the chief. Somali security forces opened fire on protesters in Mogadishu, killing at least three civilians in clashes over home demolitions and two in separate police shootings, while government troops were attacked near Leego town and al-Shabaab fighters left soldiers unburied after a deadly clash. The Somali police deputy chief warned of a security vacuum as Ugandan troops withdraw, and Egypt, Somalia and Djibouti held talks on Red Sea security and Horn of Africa stability. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE1SVFpORU5zQkRLVkp2OWNJWGplQWhXeFE5NkN4UXpOSGtzaVZNUzBfRXZ5cUxKMDliWGZ6a2I3bVMyRko4MlphZmpPdXgyVnRRcHlwdF96ZmxLems?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Business Insider Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxNbXNWUjlTNmJBZ3lRei13bS1IeF9TWnlGNG5pN0NDQ0hkQU1HYmhhaEJHekQ5d3lNcm51M2pKQno3YXAyOXBSTGlDdW5FeVJuZC1TZVpKYWNUamR1am1pTFJIUW01N3RteWNkMFdwWERQRWRIcnVTRGZsVWh4ZGJYbDJqd1k5cWRtQWpUczQ1em85WFVyUkRBd2p4SXFCaFhHV3J0WGZEbHl5dGxOdmV6d3NXakJSb2FuUDZTeC0yVUQ5aGx5?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxQZTA3dzdEbXNzR3dxbHE1d01sOTR6VjB6NXhTWUZOLTM1SnZXcDF0NUxjXzB1NDhmU3ducjdsZ2RtVS1QVHVMTVViUHNkOF9aeW9YbTBUMXNOVmVVMGNUQUlaLTUwdkpNWXR0T0dsREd6Q1VHTjg1ZE1maTBhanVKNDlibUZRYVpUVlF5UHRLZFdkYWJUUlE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Antiwar.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.go